===Talk with Huohuo{{subst:void|<!--202170501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Fyxestroll Garden|The dust has settled... quite literally. After a night full of twists, noise, and running around with the Judges, you've finally reached the end of this eerie tale. But, just like most horror movies you've seen, directors always like to leave hints for a sequel... You pray to the heavens that there won't be a sequel!}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''(Trailblazer):''' (I wonder how Huohuo is doing... I should check up on her.)

;(Talk to Xueyi)
:'''Xueyi:''' The one possessing Huohuo... seems to have disappeared. I don't know if I should be happy or sad for her...
::'''Xueyi:''' Never mind. I've never been good at figuring out emotions.
::'''Xueyi:''' Thank you for your assistance, Nameless. Reinforcements from the Ten-Lords Commission will be here soon, and Guinaifen will be sent to an apothecary.
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Your body seems to be severely malfunctioning.
:::'''Xueyi:''' It is only an artificial ingenium body. I can swap into another one easily. Do not worry.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} I don't see Judge Hanya anywhere...
:::'''Xueyi:''' Hanya returned to the Ten-Lords Commission after you left. She is coming with the reinforcements as we speak.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Is Cirrus dead?
:::'''Xueyi:''' No. The demon lives on. They even possessed a young spiritfarer under my command. "As Starfire Essences, the heliobi will never die" &mdash; the records in the Ten-Lords Commission's evil-binding tomes were all real...
:::'''Xueyi:''' Cirrus lost most of their power and poses no danger for the time being. But they will remain a threat for as long as they exist...
:::'''Xueyi:''' Thankfully, the Ten-Lords Commission had prepared other sacred vessels to suppress the heliobi. We will construct a matrix all over this abandoned garden and seal the heliobi within. The Xianzhou will live to see another day.
:::'''Xueyi:''' We can leave the rest to the Ten-Lords Commission from here... Even I feel like I need a rest.
:'''Xueyi:''' We can leave the rest to the Ten-Lords Commission from here... Even I feel like I need a rest.

;(Talk to Huohuo)
:'''Huohuo:''' Tail... Mr. Tail...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What happened to Tail...?
:::'''Huohuo:''' Tail distracted Cirrus... He helped us so much... B&mdash;But now he's gone...
:::'''Huohuo:''' I can't sense him anywhere... He's gone.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Huohuo...
:::'''Huohuo:''' What kind of judge am I...
:::'''Huohuo:''' If I were stronger, Mr. Tail wouldn't have had to sacrifice himself...
::'''Huohuo:''' It was because of him that I ended up in this terrible job...
::'''Huohuo:''' ...and I've thought so much about how much better my life would be if I never met him... but now that he's actually gone... I feel so empty inside...
::'''Huohuo:''' I really am useless... I've been looking forward to this day for so long, but now that it's here... I don't feel happy at all.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Heliobi don't die that easily.
:::'''Huohuo:''' Wait, you're right... Madam Xueyi said that heliobi are eternal flames that will never burn away. Mr. Tail... He must still be out there somewhere.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} He's free now.
:::'''Huohuo:''' ...I guess he is...
::'''Huohuo:''' Don't worry, {{MC|м=Mr.|ж=Miss}} (Trailblazer)... I'm okay. I need to pull myself together and finish the job...
::'''Huohuo:''' Oh, the Ten-Lords Commission contacted Miss Guinaifen's friend &mdash; Miss Sushang. I can't leave my post, so... could you let Miss Sushang know what happened...? She'll be relieved.
:'''Huohuo:''' ...Thank you. I'm much better now. Could you please let Miss Sushang know what happened...? She'll be relieved.

;(Talk to Possessed Spiritfarer)
:'''Possessed Spiritfarer:''' ...Grahhhh, don't even think about sealing me in the matrix!
::'''Possessed Spiritfarer:''' You wretched fools! Tail, the judges, you... One day...
::'''Possessed Spiritfarer:''' ...one day, sooner or later, I'll tear you all to pieces. I'll crunch your bones to dust, sap every drop of your strength, and spit you out into the dirt where you belong...
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} ...Cirrus?
:::'''Cirrus:''' Already forgetting me?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wanna hug, sweety?
::::'''Cirrus:''' Tsk, your human tongues are no less poisonous than ours.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I hope you repent.
::::'''Cirrus:''' Heliobi are faced with only a single punishment &mdash; eternal imprisonment. They can lock me up, but they can't kill me.
:::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Leave the kid alone.
:::'''Cirrus:''' Kid? As a spiritfarer, he's already experienced more than you could in a lifetime.
:::'''Cirrus:''' For as long as I'm sealed in the matrix, I will inhabit this body. The judges can stick as many talismans and pour as much enchanted water on this flesh as they like &mdash; I don't care. As long as they want to save their own, I still have a bargaining chip.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What tricks can you possibly pull as you are now?
:::'''Cirrus:''' There are many, (Trailblazer)... I will exist forever.
:::'''Cirrus:''' I have lived for countless years. I existed before the Alliance was even an idea. And once the Alliance has turned to dust, I will continue to exist for countless more Amber Eras.
:::'''Cirrus:''' I can wait. I'll wait for humans to let their guard down. I'll wait till the matrix drawn over Fyxestroll Garden collapses. Time and opportunity will always be on my side.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Goodbye.
:::'''Cirrus:''' ...We will meet again.
:::'''Cirrus:''' I wasn't the only heliobus to escape when the Creation Furnace was destroyed... there are more of us than the mere few in Fyxestroll Garden. Where are they now? And what will they do to the Luofu?
:::'''Cirrus:''' I look forward to seeing how the Ten-Lords Commission responds in the coming days...
:::Cirrus stares at you in silence, and you can tell from their eyes that they are conspiring.
:Cirrus stares at you in silence, and you can tell from their eyes that they are conspiring.
{{Dialogue End}}

