===Go to Aurum Alley and talk with Sushang{{subst:void|<!--202170504-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=continuance|location=Aurum Alley|update|This has now all come to an end, for the time being. Huohuo is worried about Guinaifen, and she hopes you can pass the news on soon to Guinaifen's bestie, Sushang.<br />Not going with Guinaifen to Fyxestroll Garden may have been the correct decision for Sushang to make, but it may also be one that she might come to regret... Anyway, let's go have a chat.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Sushang)
----
:'''Sushang:''' Little Gui kinda gave me an outline of what happened in the apothecary... Can you tell me more?
:'''Sushang:''' Thanks for telling me everything. I didn't think things would get so out of hand...
:'''Sushang:''' I would've been able to help you if I were there too... and maybe Little Gui wouldn't have ended up in the apothecary... *sigh*
:'''Sushang:''' You don't need to worry about Little Gui. She won't be able to sit still, even in a sick ward. I'm sure she'll come find you again in no time.
:'''Sushang:''' I'm heading to the apothecary to check up on her. Catch you later.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

